      "writtenOn": "2018-08-22T16:14:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree that the else case doesn\u0027t need to reset variables.\n\nI am more concerned about the case where caps_count is already PD_CAPS_COUNT when we receive the PD_CTRL_GET_SOURCE_CAP message and we won\u0027t actually send a SRC_CAP message to the requestor (we will just hard reset instead).\n\nI will let Scott put the +2 on (I will be OOO for the next two days)",
      "parentUuid": "be7f894b_9177b5df",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1514,
        "startChar": 3,
